''For the [[Arena]], see [[Arena Events]].''

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]'' are limited time activities that give players new challenges, adjust gameplay & mechanics, and introduce new items that are being tested by the developers for a limited time. Some events are "lore-oriented" which give an insight or backstory to the Tarkov/Norvinsk region, while other events are seasonal holiday events that are done just for fun. 
This is not a complete list, and there are many events missing.

