==Sanitar Event (11 November 2022)==
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
sanitar_event.png
</gallery></li>
'''Gameplay Changes'''
*[[Sanitar]] can be encountered on [[Customs]] with 4-5 [[Sanitar#Followers|Guards]], and has a 100% spawn chance.
*Temporary Quest [[Letters]] can be started from [[Mechanic]].

==Halloween 2022 (27 October 2022)==
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
halloween2022_event.png
</gallery></li>
'''Gameplay Changes'''
*[[Tagilla]] can be encountered on all locations, has an increased health pool of 1900 and is armed with a [[Scythe]], wears a [[Spooky skull mask]] and has an increased spawn chance.
*[[Cultists]] can be encountered on all locations besides [[The Lab]] and have an increased spawn chance.
*A random negative [[Health system#Temporary_status_effects|status effect]] is given to your PMC at the start a raid.
*[[Traders]] pictures have been "spookified". 👻
*[[Unknown toxin]] is removed upon death for free.
*[[Weapons]] will jam more frequently.
*The Escape from Tarkov website halloween "Dooomed" counter will trigger some events when it hits 666,666 and lasts for 30 minutes before resetting.
*Some [[Provisions]] no longer replenish hydration or energy.
*[[Pumpkin with sweets|Pumpkins with sweets]] can be found in the world.

