===Deadly Toxin (Day 7)===
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
toxic2022_event.png
</gallery></li>
'''Gameplay Changes'''
*Players are given infinite Stamina.
*All extracts except one are locked.
*The [[Unknown toxin]] debuff is given to your PMC at the start of the raid, which gives you 8 minutes to live unless you find an [[xTG-12 antidote injector|antidote]] on [[Bosses]] or [[airdrops]].

